   "ADR-SAG-0004 v2 (locked, kind prohibition): No sc-agent crate's Cargo.toml must depend on a crate in a higher layer, where the layers from the bottom are: types; config, secrets and log; http; decision schema; decision backends; runner. Scope: adds or changes a crate dependency in a Cargo.toml.",
